dinal number)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">第</span><span class=\"tr\">第</span><rt>dì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"a step / a pace / walk / march / stages in a process / situation\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">步</span><span class=\"tr\">步</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"měi\" data-defn=\"each / every\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tiān\" data-defn=\"day\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yào\" data-defn=\"will; shall; about to / need to; should / if\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hē\" data-defn=\"to drink\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chá\" data-defn=\"tea / tea plant\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">茶</span><span class=\"tr\">茶</span><rt>chá</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yào\" data-defn=\"will; shall; about to / need to; should / if\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kàn\" data-defn=\"to see; to look at / to read / to watch / to visit; to call on / to consider; to regard as / to look after / to treat (a patient or illness) / to depend on / to feel (that) / (after a verb) to give it a try / to watch out for\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\